    "title": "Will iconic downtown Ann Arbor breakfast spot stay open? Its retiring owner hopes so. - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By William Diep ,\n15 hours ago ANN ARBOR, MI — The owner of an iconic downtown Ann Arbor breakfast spot is retiring, but both she and a local commercial real estate executive hope the doors stay open. “We want to find the right person,” broker Jim Chaconas, executive vice president at Colliers Ann Arbor, said. “We really look for something and Joanne (Williams) will help get somebody to keep it running because it was my favorite breakfast place.” Read full article",
